**Interpretation.** Three administrative streams capture different severities. NMC (~1,013) counts clinically-notified cases (2023); NHLS (~1,779 severe inhibitions from ~10,626 BChE tests, 2023) counts severe laboratory cases; PIH (~1,158) counts clinician-initiated calls (2023). Each stream is independently sourced; the sum (~3,950) is the 2023 observed lower bound. The StatsSA-implied true annual burden is ~20,960 (mid-CFR scenario, `n_true_burden_from_statssa_mid`).

